# Sunfall: "Exile all creatures. Incubate X, where X is the number of creatures exiled this way": Bot1's Ornithopter and Bot2's
# Ornithopter both go, so X = 2 and the Incubator, made by Sunfall's controller Bot1, enters with two counters while Bot2 gets
# nothing. The Moxen, artifacts and not creatures, stay.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Sunfall
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Sunfall.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Incubator Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Incubator Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 2
